+## S4_2 — Database Layer + Web UI
+
+### Full Stack (End of S4_2)
+
+```
+Browser
+  ↓ HTTP request
+app/routes/ui.py (UI Blueprint)
+  ↓ calls
+app/services/task_service.py (TaskService)
+  ↓ calls
+app/repositories/database_task_repository.py (DatabaseTaskRepository)
+  ↓ SQLAlchemy ORM
+SQLite (tasks.db / :memory: for tests)
+```
+
+### New Files Added in S4_2
+
+```
+app/models/sqlalchemy_task.py       ← SQLAlchemy Task model
+app/routes/ui.py                    ← UI Blueprint (new)
+app/templates/base.html             ← Base template
+app/templates/add_task.html         ← Add task form
+app/templates/task_list.html        ← Task list view
+app/static/styles/style.css         ← CSS styles
+tests/conftest.py                   ← db_client fixture added
+```
+
+### create_app() Repository Selection
+
+```python
+create_app()              → FileTaskRepository()      → tasks.json
+create_app(use_db=True)   → DatabaseTaskRepository()  → tasks.db
+create_app(service=mock)  → mocker.MagicMock()        → no I/O
+```
